# Keep SQL migrations byte-identical and host-independent so sqlx::migrate!
# compile-time checksums stay stable across machines (LF everywhere). The
# committed (index) form of every migration is already LF; this pins the
# working-tree form to LF too. Path-agnostic on purpose: the migrations dir
# moves under the lumina workspace carve (lumina/migrations -> later
# lumina/core/migrations), so a fixed path would go stale.
*.sql text eol=lf
